title:    How the implementation is organised
subtitle: Major directories only. Full source on GitHub.
width:    760
---
week-05-project-factory/
├── LAB.md              reproduction guide: the four roles, field probing, quota
├── terraform/
│   ├── main.tf         tag key, two values, the custom constraint
│   └── modules/project/ the reusable project: labels, tag, contacts, APIs
├── scripts/            validate.sh - checks what the factory produced
└── docs/               figure plan, references, screenshots

# modules/project/  the point of the week: one module that makes a project
#                   which is correct by construction.
# main.tf           the constraint that refuses an incorrect one - in dry run,
#                   and limited to the two fields a Project actually exposes.
